"pouvez aussi les avoir comme apps à part dans le menu des applications et le "
"dock."
msgstr ""
"Messages, Phone, Contacts and Headphones are always in Covalence. You can also"
" have them as separate apps in the Applications menu and the dock."

#: src/Onboarding.vala:317
msgid "C'est prêt"
msgstr "All Set"

#: src/Onboarding.vala:318
msgid ""
"Covalence tourne en arrière-plan : les notifications, messages et appels "
"arrivent même fenêtre fermée. Pour refaire cette configuration, ouvrez le menu"
" en haut à droite de Covalence."
msgstr ""
"Covalence runs in the background: notifications, messages and calls arrive "
"even with the window closed. To go through this setup again, open Settings in "
"Covalence."

